<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/20/73749426/b2e2438694ca6abf803db1c9cbc2e45c_2105643487556205103.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">440</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">20</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「对、对不起，我刚刚的样子是不是吓到你了？但我不想让任何人伤害到你······」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">少女的脸上写满忐忑，却依旧紧握手中武器——即使浴血奋战，即使遍体鳞伤，她也要守护自己珍视之人。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">仲夏夜的约定</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:17秒]展开十字架【召唤物】：生成持续17秒的领域【红月界线】（唯一生效），处于【红月界线】中的角色造成的雷电元素伤害提高50.0%，角色在领域中造成流血伤害时，使角色自身获得【噬痕】，每层【噬痕】使得流血伤害的全伤害提高2.0%，【噬痕】持续10秒，上限10层，具有0.1秒触发间隔。重复触发刷新持续时间。十字架消失时清空所有【噬痕】。月下誓约 · 予爱以心装备时获得以下效果：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">伤害、冷却时间与能量消耗等属性由角色自身决定，月下誓约 · 予爱以心进入【狂化】状态时，在身旁生成蝙蝠【召唤物】，蝙蝠跟随场上的角色移动，触发【红月界线】所有效果，持续时间17秒。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">红月下的城堡</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色自身造成的雷电元素伤害提高30.0%，【红月界线】中的敌人受到流血伤害提高10.0%。月下誓约 · 予爱以心在队伍中时，【红月界线】中的敌人每秒获得1点流血积蓄值。月下誓约 · 予爱以心装备时，其必杀技最后一击的额外倍率提高300.0%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">世界外的尽头</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">分支攻击全伤害提高20.0%，月下誓约 · 予爱以心使用时，分支攻击全伤害额外提高30.0%</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2713/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/20/73749426/4712bbf25f97834f1039f72b8ee45e3b_6521626219325983584.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「血染赤匣」图鉴后任意十字架蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*50</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*4</span></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl